WEBVTT

00:01:29.288 --> 00:01:31.246
Main kahaan jaana chaahata hoon,

00:01:31.246 --> 00:01:32.579
agar kaheen bhee?

00:01:32.579 --> 00:01:34.913
Main kaise chaahate hoon 
ki ve mere saath apane

00:01:34.913 --> 00:01:36.454
rishte ko samajhen?

00:01:36.454 --> 00:01:38.579
Mere maamale mein,
main chaahata tha

00:01:38.579 --> 00:01:40.996
ki log mujhe mere nae naam
aur sarvanaam se lulaen

00:01:40.996 --> 00:01:42.663
Lekin, main nahin chaahata tha

00:01:42.663 --> 00:01:45.163
ki gadabad karane ke dar se
mujhase bachen

00:01:45.163 --> 00:01:46.579
Yeh samay lene vaala tha

00:01:46.579 --> 00:01:49.538
Main chaahata tha ki yeh 
mere baare mein ek aur

00:01:49.538 --> 00:01:50.579
chees mahasoos kare

00:01:50.579 --> 00:01:53.163
To ab ham jaanate hain
ki ham kya chaahate hain

00:01:53.163 --> 00:01:55.038
To ham ise kaise kahate hain?

00:01:55.038 --> 00:01:56.204
Svar set karake

00:01:56.413 --> 00:01:58.704
Aapako usee tarah see 
batanee hain jis tarah

00:01:58.704 --> 00:02:00.329
se aap javaab dena chaahate hain